
This directory contains the C overlay loader and some
other junk.  Covld is derived from Bill Joy's covld
but several things (such as the format of thunks)
have been changed and many bugs have been fixed.
The paper in ovpap.n describes the original Berkeley
overlayed text scheme which was intended for use in
user mode programs.  I use overlays only for the kernel
itself.  The paper is good for background, but many of
the details are wrong.

